    {
      "id": "claim_8e656810f2e545ca9d1af100e7663716",
      "statement": "In the reference compose deployment llm-replay runs on the egress-free internal network with SANDMAN_LLM_UPSTREAM=http://llm-gateway:8080/openai, cassettes backed by the host volume data/llm-records, and startup health-gated as llm-gateway healthy, then llm-replay, then the agents (x-depends-core), so the proxy is a hard startup dependency of every LLM-using service.",
