      "id": "claim_bcaf500f47f34e6180647e3780fddeed",
      "statement": "llm-replay is a standalone Starlette service that does not depend on the shared sandman_agent library (dependencies only httpx, rfc8785, starlette, uvicorn); it is started by `python -m sandman_llm_replay` running uvicorn on PORT (default 8000), and module-level `app` is resolved lazily via __getattr__ so importing the module requires no environment.",
