      "id": "claim_2739d04478424efe8c51b050ee4349e5",
      "statement": "Every proxied request produces one structured JSON log line on stdout with ts, level, service llm-replay, mode, path, outcome (hit, miss, recorded, forwarded or rejected), status and, when a key was computed, the cassette key.",
