    {
      "id": "claim_1050c74a59614fcf8cc31b3ee56bf774",
      "statement": "services/llm-replay/tests/test_app.py pins the proxy's invariants against a mocked httpx transport with no network: the cassetteKey conformance vectors from contracts/conformance/vectors.json, that user/stream do not change the key, live pass-through of query string and Authorization, record dedupe and serving from a pre-existing cassette, replay hit/miss and GET /openai/models 404, streaming rejection before any upstream call, non-200 upstream responses passed through unrecorded, malformed cassette aborting create_app, invalid SANDMAN_LLM_MODE failing Settings.from_env, and /v1/status 401s plus hit/miss/entry counters.",
